the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    Application is_complete holds for *a case*.
    the answer to Application is_complete for *a case* is *a truth value*; scenario element.
    Application is_complete would hold for *a case*; unknown.

the knowledge base r3_3_accept_suspended_with_comment includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/accept-suspended-with-comment.ruml".

Application is_complete holds for a case if
    the answer to Application is_complete for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Application is_complete holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Application is_complete for the case is a truth value
    and Application is_complete would hold for the case.

